# 构建上下文最小化: 只把这几类东西带进 docker build, 其余全部忽略
#   1) opencode 二进制 (可选预装; 目录里平时只有 .gitkeep)
#   2) config/bashrc        → 镜像内默认 ~/.bashrc
#   3) config/HOME-README.md → 镜像内 ~/README.md (HOME 目录说明)
#   4) test-oracle-instantclient.sh → 镜像内自检脚本
*
!opencode-bin-cli
!opencode-bin-cli/**
!config
!config/bashrc
!config/HOME-README.md
!test-oracle-instantclient.sh
